# What the image of the site never takes (Dockerfile): the installed packages of the Mac, the history, the local base,
# the 3D files of the Mac (except the test model), the checks and every secret. The photos and videos of the site
# (public/media, 1 GB) stay beside the image: docker-compose.yml lends them to the site (dist/media).
public/media
node_modules
.git
.github
.local
.data
.vercel
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
dist
dist-ssr
dist-server
server/generated
storage/*
!storage/demo/
verification
test-results
playwright-report
scripts/.import-media-cache.json
scripts/.share-images-cache.json
**/.DS_Store
